<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel introduces CD-ROM &quot;Yellow Pages&quot;.</title>
<headline>SingTel introduces CD-ROM &quot;Yellow Pages&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecom (SingTel) said on Tuesday it was introducing Asia's first comprehensive CD-ROM-version of a &quot;Yellow Pages&quot; telephone buying guide.</p>
<p>The CD-ROM, which will go on sale from October 10 at Singapore $29.95, combines all Singapore's retail &quot;Yellow Pages&quot; with the city-state's Commercial and Industrial guides for businesses.</p>
<p>The CD-ROM will be &quot;extensively distributed abroad&quot; to help promote Singapore companies in the global market, SingTel's president and chief executive officer Lee Hsien Yang told a news conference. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
